{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/extras/af8f747cc5567e2990da9b30967d6475.apng?t=1772097339\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/extras/af8f747cc5567e2990da9b30967d6475.poster.avif?t=1772097339\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=35 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endwell</strong> is a narrative driven adventure game about cats, mice, humans and <strong>The End</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is finally happening: the End of the Days. People are paralyzed as if they were struck by lightning. Is this really it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apparent answer stays the same: it is. <strong>WE ARE DONE FOR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/extras/97f1111f2c54d3704ac21e6a90ccc6bd.webp?t=1772097339\" width=602 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, bringing out the small guns: <strong>Cat Couriers INC.</strong> is a cor<i>purr</i>ation aiming to \u201ccheer hoomans up\u201d one package at a time. You play as <strong>Oreo</strong>, a junior Cat Courier, delivering packages to humans on the eve of this catastrophic event. Meanwhile, scientists are devising a plan to save whatever life they can by building a space rocket: <strong>the Escape Crate</strong> for the entire Earth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/extras/c6d344f1939afcf14d37a58af69e92a8.webp?t=1772097339\" width=602 height=37 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a CC, your job is to find your way across a small town, deliver packages to people to bring them comfort and some conclusion, gather parts for building the Escape Crate and make all your customers happy before Earth's time runs out.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/extras/c2143eb4813ba55857af3bd2b82bd88a.webp?t=1772097339\" width=602 height=31 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get immersed in the people\u2019s stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver packages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find essential parts for the Escape Crate space rocket</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Remnants of Hoomanity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only you can deliver the final smiles before the last sunset!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/extras/af8f747cc5567e2990da9b30967d6475.apng?t=1772097339\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/extras/af8f747cc5567e2990da9b30967d6475.poster.avif?t=1772097339\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=35 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617530?t=1772097339","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/95c871e883b43f7e2c066292805f96c4a0e2e51f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772097339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617530/a1d294e0d46a28dede4e7fc4e8a1c2a5c534386d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772097339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/